<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title> 빙고 — 마인크래프트 아이템 빙고판</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bedrock:#1b1a17;
    --stone:#26241f;
    --stone-light:#332f28;
    --limestone:#e9e2d0;
    --limestone-dim:#c9c0a9;
    --ochre:#e8a33d;
    --sage:#7c9473;
    --sage-dark:#5a7057;
    --rust:#c17a4a;
    --rust-dark:#8f5330;
    --amethyst:#a179d9;
    --amethyst-dark:#6b4a8a;
    --ember:#d9542f;
    --line-glow:#ffe9a8;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, #2a2721 0%, transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 100%, #201d19 0%, transparent 50%),
      var(--bedrock);
    color:var(--limestone);
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "Pretendard", "Noto Sans KR", ui-sans-serif, sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    padding:32px 16px 60px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .mono{ font-family: ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace; }

  header{ width:100%; max-width:920px; text-align:center; margin-bottom:28px; }
  .eyebrow{ font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.25em; color:var(--ochre); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:10px; }
  h1{ font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.15; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  h1 span{ color:var(--ochre); }
  .sub{ color:var(--limestone-dim); font-size:14.5px; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.6; }

  .panel{ width:100%; max-width:920px; background:var(--stone); border:1px solid #3a352c; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; margin-bottom:22px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.03); }
  .row{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:18px 28px; align-items:flex-end; }
  .field{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .field label{ font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--limestone-dim); font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .seg{ display:flex; border:1px solid #454034; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden; }
  .seg button{ background:var(--stone-light); color:var(--limestone-dim); border:none; padding:8px 14px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; border-right:1px solid #454034; transition: background .15s, color .15s; }
  .seg button:last-child{ border-right:none; }
  .seg button.active{ background:var(--ochre); color:#1b1a17; }
  .seg button:hover:not(.active){ background:#3d382e; color:var(--limestone); }

  .tier-toggle{ display:flex; gap:8px; }
  .tier-chip{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:7px 12px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid transparent; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; user-select:none; transition: opacity .15s, transform .1s; }
  .tier-chip:active{ transform:scale(.97); }
  .tier-chip.off{ opacity:.35; }
  .tier-chip[data-tier="easy"]{ background:rgba(124,148,115,.18); border-color:var(--sage-dark); color:var(--sage); }
  .tier-chip[data-tier="medium"]{ background:rgba(193,122,74,.18); border-color:var(--rust-dark); color:var(--rust); }
  .tier-chip[data-tier="hard"]{ background:rgba(161,121,217,.18); border-color:var(--amethyst-dark); color:var(--amethyst); }
  .tier-chip .dot{ width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:2px; background:currentColor; }

  .spacer{ flex:1; }
  .btn{ padding:10px 20px; border-radius:6px; border:none; font-weight:800; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.02em; cursor:pointer; transition: filter .15s, transform .1s; }
  .btn:active{ transform:scale(.97); }
  .btn-primary{ background:var(--ochre); color:#1b1a17; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #a5701f; }
  .btn-primary:hover{ filter:brightness(1.08); }
  .btn-ghost{ background:transparent; color:var(--limestone-dim); border:1px solid #454034; }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ color:var(--limestone); border-color:#5a5344; }

  .count-note{ font-size:12px; color:var(--limestone-dim); margin-top:8px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .count-note b{ color:var(--ochre); }
  .warn{ color:var(--ember) !important; }

  .status{ width:100%; max-width:920px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:14px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size:13px; color:var(--limestone-dim); }
  .status .bingo-count b{ color:var(--line-glow); font-size:15px; }

  .board-wrap{ width:100%; max-width:920px; position:relative; }
  .board{ display:grid; gap:8px; width:100%; }
  .cell{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--stone-light) 0%, var(--stone) 100%);
    border-radius:4px;
    cursor:pointer;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    padding:8px;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;
    border:1px solid #3a352c;
  }
  .cell:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
  .cell .stratum{ position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:6px; }
  .cell[data-tier="easy"] .stratum{ background:var(--sage); }
  .cell[data-tier="medium"] .stratum{ background:var(--rust); }
  .cell[data-tier="hard"] .stratum{ background:var(--amethyst); }

  .cell .tier-label{ font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size:9px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:8px; opacity:.6; }
  .cell[data-tier="easy"] .tier-label{ color:var(--sage); }
  .cell[data-tier="medium"] .tier-label{ color:var(--rust); }
  .cell[data-tier="hard"] .tier-label{ color:var(--amethyst); }

  .cell .qty{ position:absolute; top:6px; right:7px; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--ochre); background:rgba(0,0,0,.28); padding:2px 6px; border-radius:10px; letter-spacing:.02em; }

  .cell .name{ flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(11px,1.6vw,15px); line-height:1.25; padding:2px 2px; word-break:keep-all; }

  .cell.checked{ background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a4a37 0%, #2a3527 100%); border-color: var(--sage); }
  .cell.checked::after{ content:"✓"; position:absolute; right:6px; bottom:4px; font-size:18px; color:var(--sage); font-weight:900; }
  .cell.checked .name{ color:var(--limestone-dim); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color: rgba(233,226,208,.4); }

  .cell.win-line{ animation: glow 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; border-color: var(--line-glow) !important; }
  @keyframes glow{ 0%,100%{ box-shadow: 0 0 0px rgba(255,233,168,0); } 50%{ box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,233,168,.55); } }

  .free{ background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4a3a1f 0%, #362a17 100%) !important; border-color: var(--ochre) !important; }
  .free .name{ color:var(--ochre); }

  footer{ margin-top:26px; font-size:12px; color:var(--limestone-dim); text-align:center; max-width:640px; line-height:1.7; }

  @media (max-width:520px){ .row{ gap:12px 18px; } .status{ font-size:11.5px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="eyebrow mono">MINECRAFT JAVA EDITION · ITEM BINGO</div>
  <h1>채굴 <span>빙고</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">게임 내 실제 아이템 이름으로만 구성된 빙고판입니다. 난이도별로 섞인 미션을 완료하고, 획득한 아이템을 클릭해서 표시해보세요.</p>
</header>

<div class="panel">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="field">
      <label>보드 크기</label>
      <div class="seg" id="sizeSeg">
        <button data-size="3">3×3</button>
        <button data-size="4">4×4</button>
        <button data-size="5" class="active">5×5</button>
        <button data-size="6">6×6</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>난이도 구성</label>
      <div class="tier-toggle" id="tierToggle">
        <div class="tier-chip" data-tier="easy"><span class="dot"></span>쉬움</div>
        <div class="tier-chip" data-tier="medium"><span class="dot"></span>보통</div>
        <div class="tier-chip" data-tier="hard"><span class="dot"></span>어려움</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field">
      <label>가운데 칸</label>
      <div class="seg" id="freeSeg">
        <button data-free="1" class="active">자유 칸</button>
        <button data-free="0">아이템 채우기</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

    <div class="field">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="resetBtn">체크 초기화</button>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="genBtn">새 빙고판 생성</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="count-note" id="countNote"></div>
</div>

<div class="status">
  <div>아이템 데이터베이스 <b class="mono" id="dbCount" style="color:var(--ochre)"></b>개 (전부 게임 내 실제 아이템명)</div>
  <div class="bingo-count">빙고 <b id="bingoCount">0</b>줄</div>
</div>

<div class="board-wrap">
  <div class="board" id="board"></div>
</div>

<footer>
  칸을 클릭하면 획득 체크가 되고, 다시 클릭하면 취소됩니다. 가로·세로·대각선을 완성하면 해당 줄이 빛납니다.<br>
  우측 상단 숫자는 목표 수량입니다. 도구·갑옷·물약처럼 여러 개를 모으는 게 의미 없는 아이템은 자동으로 1개로 고정돼요.
</footer>

<script>
/* ---------------- Item database (tiered) ----------------
   전부 게임 내 실제 아이템/블록명 (한국어 공식 명칭 기준, Java Edition).
   세트로 묶이는 장비류(도구/갑옷)는 개별 아이템으로 분리했습니다. */
const ITEMS = {
